# Copy to .env.local (gitignored). The gates resolve the key from THIS file
# first, then .env, then LEGION_REPO/.env.local, then the environment (last —
# a stale OS-level export is a known trap). Use a dedicated key with a
# server-side spending cap: one runaway pro-tier run once took an account
# negative, and a negative balance blocks the free tier too.
ZENMUX_API_KEY=

# Optional: any OpenAI-compatible gateway
# LEGION_UPSTREAM_URL=https://zenmux.ai/api/v1
# Optional: a sibling repo whose .env.local holds the shared key
# LEGION_REPO=/path/to/another/repo

# Rosters — defaults are what one domain's auditions found. Re-audition on
# yours (examples/auditions/*) and overwrite. Seat by ROLE, not by family.
# LEGION_BRAIN_ROSTER=deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash,z-ai/glm-5.3-flash,inclusionai/ling-3.0-flash
# LEGION_BRAIN_SECOND_ROSTER=openai/gpt-5.6-luna,openai/gpt-5-mini
# LEGION_MUSCLE_ROSTER=deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash,inclusionai/ling-3.0-flash
# LEGION_SECOND_ROSTER=tencent/hy3,z-ai/glm-5.3-flash
# LEGION_IMPL_ROSTER=openai/gpt-5-nano,openai/gpt-5.4-nano,qwen/qwen3.8-flash
# LEGION_BRAIN_EFFORT=low        # medium for hard planning; never omit — see docs
